# Docker build context hygiene for the repository-root builds.
#
# Only the sandbox images are built with the repository root as their context
# (the core images consume agent-control-tower/runtime-sandbox plus, for Qoder,
# packages/qoder-acp-bridge); every other build in this repository uses a
# narrower context, so this file only affects those sandbox image builds.
.git
.gitignore
.superpowers
.qoder
.env
.env.*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/target
**/.pnpm-store
**/*.log
docs
e2e/screenshots
agent-control-tower/act-dashboard
agent-control-tower/opencode-sandbox/README.md
# The dev H2 database lives under the app's data dir and is locked by a running
# backend; the repository-root sandbox image builds must never send it.
agent-control-tower/act-app/data
*.md
